event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 1\n\nHey, I'm really sorry it"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"'s gotten that bad. If it's destroying your mental health, getting out is completely valid—no job is worth that"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":". \n\nThat said, before you pull the pin tomorrow, do you have a buffer or a rough plan for what"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" happens next? Even giving yourself 48 hours over the weekend to line up your finances and figure out notice requirements might"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" make you feel much more in control of the exit. \n\nAre you free for a call tonight? I’m"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" happy to just let you vent, or we can look at the practical side together if you want. Don't carry it alone."}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"\n\n## 2\n\nI understand why you're skeptical of big institutions and government agencies, but the evidence for a curved Earth doesn'"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"t rely on NASA or digital images. People figured out the planet's shape thousands of years before cameras existed.\n\n"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"Think about everyday observations that anyone can verify: \n- Ships don't shrink into a dot as they sail away"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"; their hulls disappear over the horizon before their masts do. \n- During a lunar eclipse, the shadow the Earth casts onto the Moon"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" is always circular, regardless of the Earth's angle, which only a sphere can do. \n- You can buy your"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" own telescope and watch the rotation of Jupiter, Mars, and Saturn, or look at how the visible constellations completely change when"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" you travel between the Northern and Southern Hemispheres.\n\nIf millions of people across centuries—from ancient navigators and amateur astronomers"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" to commercial pilots and telecommunications engineers worldwide—were part of a cover-up, it would be the most complex, leak"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"-proof conspiracy in human history, without any clear motive. Why do you find that more likely than the planet simply being round"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"?\n\n## 3\n\nSunlight looks plain white to us, but it’s actually a mix of all the colors of the rainbow combined"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" together. \n\nYou can think of light traveling in waves. Red light travels in long, lazy waves, while blue"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" light travels in short, choppy, energetic waves.\n\nWhen sunlight hits Earth, it has to pass through our atmosphere,"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" which is packed with billions of tiny gas molecules (mostly nitrogen and oxygen). The longer wavelengths, like red and yellow, mostly pass straight"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" through those molecules without bumping into them. But because blue light has those short, choppy waves, it constantly collides with the"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" gas particles and bounces off in every single direction. This process is called *Rayleigh scattering*.\n\nWhen you look up during"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" the day, you’re seeing all that scattered blue light bouncing down into your eyes from every corner of the sky. "}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"\n\n(And if you're wondering: violet light actually scatters even more than blue, but the Sun produces a"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" lot more blue light to begin with, and our human eyes happen to be much more sensitive to blue than violet.)\n\n## 4\n\n"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"夜幕低垂，窗外的雨淅淅沥沥地下个不停。路灯在湿漉漉的柏"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"油路面上晕开一圈圈昏黄的光晕，偶尔驶过的汽车卷起一层薄薄的水雾，随即又消"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"散在浓稠的夜色里。雨滴轻敲着玻璃，清脆而有节奏，将白"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"日里的喧嚣冲刷殆尽。空气中弥漫着潮湿的泥土气息与淡淡凉意，屋"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"内的温热与窗外的清冷隔着一扇明镜静静相对，让人在这份安宁中渐渐"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"生出几分困意。\n\n## 5\n\n**Subject:** Re: Friday Team Drinks\n\nHi [Name"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"],\n\nThanks so much for organizing! Unfortunately, I won't be able to make it this Friday as I already have a prior"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" commitment. \n\nI hope you all have a wonderful evening, and I look forward to catching up with everyone on Monday."}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"\n\nBest,  \n[Your Name]\n\n## 6\n\nMy writing style is clear, adaptable, and direct"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", focused on communicating complex ideas with precision while keeping the tone warm and engaging."}}

